{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b1d73b30-2395-89bd-9e2c-16d72e42e8d4",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T13:10:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Odete Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Lorraine. Well, I'm seventy-something and I'm calling about a pole, so you can see I really know how to live it up on a Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what we're here for. Which pole is it, a streetlight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:08:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A streetlight pole, yes. Somebody hit it with a car sometime over the weekend, during that nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. It's leaning over now. Not falling, but leaning, like me getting out of a chair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:08:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a streetlight pole that's leaning after a car struck it. Where is it located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my building, 217 Bridge Street, down the Point. I'm the landlord there. I own it, I don't live on the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 217 Bridge Street, in The Point. Is the light still on, or is it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's out. It was dark last night. And the pole's tilted toward the sidewalk, so I'd like somebody to come look at it. A crew, whoever does that. Before somebody walks under it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll put in a request for a crew to check the pole. Let me read it back. Leaning streetlight pole, hit by a car, light is out, in front of 217 Bridge Street. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. You got it better than I would have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you know if any wires are down or hanging, or is it just the lean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No wires on the ground that I can see. Just the lean. I looked from the porch, I didn't go poking at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, please keep it that way. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0172. Okay, that's in the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:10:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now I have to run, I'm picking up a cake at the bakery for a retirement party this afternoon. If I'm late, there'll be no cake and a lot of unhappy retirees."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then don't let me keep you. A crew will get out to take a look, probably in the next day or two given the storm cleanup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy the party."
    }
  ],
